      <h2 class="CH"><a name="3.12"></a>CHAPTER 3-12<br />SHORT-TERM RENTALS</h2>
            <p class="digCH">SECTIONS:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff03/Flagstaff0312000.html#3.12.001.0001">3-12-001-0001</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;PURPOSE</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff03/Flagstaff0312000.html#3.12.001.0002">3-12-001-0002</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;DEFINITIONS</p>

